  "description": "One day Kagami Kazuya, an ordinary boy, encounters Kiriha, a beautiful girl in a kimono. It turns out Kiriha is a tsukumogami, a spirit, whose true identity is the precious obi Kazuya carries around as a memory of his late mother. All kinds of bizarre things unfold in this supernatural action comedy! <br><br>\n\n(Source: Funimation)",
  "siteUrl": "https://anilist.co/anime/97625",
