    {
      "role": "MAIN",
      "node": {
        "id": 128857,
        "name": {
          "full": "Kukuri",
          "native": "くくり",
          "alternative": [
            "菊理媛大神",
            "Kukurihime Ogami",
            "Kukuri-Hime-no-Kami"
          ]
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b128857-JXCZHNSiTtGQ.jpg"
        },
        "description": "Kukuri-Hime-no-Kami, better known simply as Kukuri, is the resident God of the Land of the Hakusan Shrine. She is one of many gods known as Kukuri, with this incarnation residing over Kamioka. She guards over the region, dispersing curse and assisting [Kazuya](https://anilist.co/character/126356/Kagami-Kazuya) in his job as an exorcist.\n\nDue to her status as a God of the Land, Kukuri doesn't age, regardless of how much time passes. Instead, her appearance is tied to the amount of power she possesses, boasting a youthful but adult aspect when at full strength but rejuvenating when her power decreases. Some traits are consistently carried over, such as her green hair and blue eyes. She always sports the same attire consisting of an orange haori, a kimono jacket, and a pair of black hakama, divided trousers that extend all the way to the ankles. As well as a white bandana. Because of certain circumstances and, after her test to appoint Kazuya as the new Exorcist of Kamioka; Kukuri suffered a drastic change in looks that resemble that of a very young girl. In her daily life when not attending her duties as the Local God, she's also seen wearing all different kinds of casual clothing typical of girls of her physiological age.\n\nKukuri was one of the esteemed three thousand Gods of the sacred mountain of Kaga and was at some point considered powerful enough to carry the title of a God of the Land, assigned to the region of Kamioka to act as its major deity, as well as getting a Stone Shard from the celestial pillar implanted inside her body. She carried the responsibility of purifying the curse of the land for an unknown period of time. Kamioka had a reputation of being a particularly unstable region, where high-level aberrations would often be formed, and as such the exorcist applied to her area was one of incredibly high skill.\n",
